		"text_data": {
			"1777717990.077--9223372036854775799": "I want to end the world.<mp>\nI want to end myself.<mp>\nI want to annihilate all I have built, for it is nothing but a hollow vessel of pretense progress.<mp>\nIf I were to summarize it all in a single sentiment, it'd be: <ap>[i]I really want to blow up my life.[/i]",
			"1777718003.839--9223372036854775796": "I want to be a fuckup.<mp>\nIt could feel so horrible to hurt everyone that cares about me.<mp>\nHorribleness is a good thing.<mp>\nIt's me at my best.<mp>\nI couldn't alleviate the weight of the past and it keeps clawing its way back and it wants to carve and bolt and sunder through everything that exists.",
			"1777718012.883--9223372036854775793": "One day and continuously, <ruby:stability is a fake concept but bear with me>stability</ruby> entered my life.",
			"1777718027.970--9223372036854775790": "She wants to call me her girlfriend, sometimes.<mp>\nShe wraps her arms around me and it feels nice on all levels.<mp>\nThere is nothing to complain about.<mp>\nThat is something to latch onto.<mp>\nWhat if I burned it all down?<mp>\nRelying on someone and not being disappointed is a nice change.<mp>\nThis is a horrifying change.<mp>\nThis is a stability I've never known and I think that means I have to become the sudden disappointment again.<mp>\nSuddenly there's something to break beyond the inherent bond we share.<mp>\nAnd my brain really latches onto that. <ap>So so hard.<mp>",
			"1777718035.494--9223372036854775787": "Everyone says I'm doing the right thing when I take care of her emotions.<mp>\nI'm proud of myself for being bigger than so many before me. I make space. This is good for the future.",
			"1777718042.312--9223372036854775784": "But the enticement of new experiences is ever beckoning, even if they threaten to make me lose her - <ap>my world - <ap>and further drive me back to cutting myself.<mp>\nAnd that in itself is a fallacy because I can have new experiences with her, I would love nothing more than to share experiences with her.<mp>\nBut that is not self-destruction and so my brain searches for ways to hurt me so deeply.<mp>\nFuck.",
			"1777718043.763--9223372036854775781": "I'm worthless.<mp>\nI'm worthless, deep down.",
			"1777718043.930--9223372036854775778": "I want to destroy my life.",
			"1777718044.097--9223372036854775775": "I want to prove them right.<mp>\nProve right their inner hidden thoughts that I had never been worthy of anything after all.<mp>\nI want to show them that the care they place in me would've been better elsewhere.<mp>\nI could ruin it all in an instant.<mp>\nThere's nothing stopping you from withering all your friendships.<mp>\nLet your life consume you. <ap>Make your job kill you. <ap>Tell everyone that you hate them. <ap>Tell them your true thoughts. <ap>They are worthless to you. <ap>You can survive on your own. <ap>That's how you made it into your teens. <ap>There are no consequences.",
			"1777718066.871--9223372036854775772": "There's online fandom now and I couldn't give less of a shit.<mp>\nI keep trying to build something. I can build something with the help of those that love me.<mp>\nWhatever it is that I'm capable of, is catastrophe.",
			"1777718071.743--9223372036854775766": "I buried the seed deep in the rock over yonder. The seed of self destruction.<mp>\nBut I can feel it growing again.<mp>\nIt feeds on granite and stasis.<mp>\nThe clouds crash over me and hang me higher. Yet I breathe. Because I resist.",
			"1777718071.924--9223372036854775763": "What is it that I'm resisting? <ap>I do not know. <mp>I could never know. No one cares. No one should care. For now, this is an inner tar pit. Gravel pelts me. I try to not give into the beauty of the welts.",
			"1777718072.057--9223372036854775760": "Life can be worth something.<mp>\nEven if I don't feel something.<mp>\nMy thoughts drift away once more and I look out at the pale morning horizon.<mp>\nOnce I soar up again, perhaps I can see this life be worth more than the ashes of its immolation again.",
			"1777718143.730--9223372036854775697": "For now, I'm vomiting up words and hoping to see iridescence glimmer back at me in the bile.<mp>\nWonderful.",
			"1777718144.046--9223372036854775694": "I sigh.<mp>\nI'm tired.<mp>\nThis life is worth living.<mp>\nThis life has been worth living.<mp>\nNot fucking up everything is a sign of growth.<mp>\nI'm proud to be finally here.<mp>\nThis is a new experience and I don't want it to end yet. Not truly, deep down.<mp>\nThis is wonderful. ",
			"1777718156.626--9223372036854775691": "And yet...",
			"1777718156.791--9223372036854775688": "[b]Some days, it's really difficult to resist the urge to blow up my life.<mp>\nEvery day, I have to resist the urge to blow up my life.[/b]"
		},
